Neither shop's product listings nor manuals are part of this repository.
scripts/ikea/fetch.ts downloads IKEA's listings for local use, and only the
catalog rows derived from them (names, product types and sizes in src/data)
ship with the app. Kmart's rows in src/data/kmart.ts are names, keycodes and
sizes as Kmart publishes them; its manuals are read, never copied.

Assembly guides are generated drawings, not IKEA's or Kmart's instructions.
Always check them against the official manual that comes with the product.
